From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] ncrypt: forward BCryptKeyDerivation to bcrypt

ncrypt.dll exports the bcrypt functions by forwarding them; BCryptKeyDerivation was a spec stub there (a program linking it from ncrypt crashed calling it).
---
--- a/dlls/ncrypt/ncrypt.spec
+++ b/dlls/ncrypt/ncrypt.spec
@@ -35,7 +35,7 @@
 @ stdcall BCryptHashData(ptr ptr long long) bcrypt.BCryptHashData
 @ stdcall BCryptImportKey(ptr ptr wstr ptr ptr long ptr long long) bcrypt.BCryptImportKey
 @ stdcall BCryptImportKeyPair(ptr ptr wstr ptr ptr long long) bcrypt.BCryptImportKeyPair
-@ stub BCryptKeyDerivation
+@ stdcall BCryptKeyDerivation(ptr ptr ptr long ptr long) bcrypt.BCryptKeyDerivation
 @ stdcall BCryptOpenAlgorithmProvider(ptr wstr wstr long) bcrypt.BCryptOpenAlgorithmProvider
 @ stdcall BCryptQueryContextConfiguration(long wstr ptr ptr) bcrypt.BCryptQueryContextConfiguration
 @ stdcall BCryptQueryContextFunctionConfiguration(long wstr long wstr ptr ptr) bcrypt.BCryptQueryContextFunctionConfiguration
